{"title":"Career Roadmap: Leather Technology Merchandiser","role":"Leather Technology Merchandiser","summary":"A Leather Technology Merchandiser connects the technical production team with buyers, brands and suppliers. The role combines leather technology, product development, sourcing, costing, quality control, production planning and communication.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Course":"Leather Technology"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Develop technical leather knowledge, product development, costing, sourcing, buyer coordination, quality management and commercial merchandising skills"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Leather Technology Merchandiser connects the technical production team with buyers, brands and suppliers. The role combines leather technology, product development, sourcing, costing, quality control, production planning and communication."},{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate should understand both how leather products are manufactured and how commercial orders move from buyer requirement to final shipment."}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof to Create","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"1st Year"},{"text":"Leather & manufacturing fundamentals"},{"text":"Leather science, chemistry, materials"},{"text":"Leather identification portfolio"},{"text":"Only theoretical knowledge"}],[{"text":"2nd Year"},{"text":"Processing + product knowledge"},{"text":"Tanning, finishing, footwear/leather goods"},{"text":"Leather/product analysis project"},{"text":"Weak understanding of production"}],[{"text":"3rd Year"},{"text":"Merchandising + costing"},{"text":"Sourcing, costing, production planning"},{"text":"Product costing sheet + tech pack"},{"text":"No commercial exposure"}],[{"text":"4th Year"},{"text":"Buyer & production management"},{"text":"Quality, negotiation, export, supply chain"},{"text":"Complete merchandising capstone"},{"text":"No internship/industry experience"}]]}]},{"heading":"Semester-by-Semester Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Semesters 1–2 — Engineering Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engineering mathematics"},{"text":"Engineering chemistry"},{"text":"Physics"},{"text":"Basic computer applications"},{"text":"Engineering drawing"},{"text":"Communication skills"},{"text":"Basic economics and management"},{"text":"Introduction to leather and allied materials"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build familiarity with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Natural vs synthetic materials"},{"text":"Leather terminology"},{"text":"Leather grades and characteristics"},{"text":"Basic product categories"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semesters 3–4 — Leather Technology Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Leather raw materials"},{"text":"Hide and skin structure"},{"text":"Leather defects"},{"text":"Preservation and curing"},{"text":"Beamhouse operations"},{"text":"Liming"},{"text":"Deliming"},{"text":"Bating"},{"text":"Pickling"},{"text":"Tanning"},{"text":"Retanning"},{"text":"Dyeing"},{"text":"Fatliquoring"},{"text":"Finishing"},{"text":"Leather grading"},{"text":"Physical and chemical testing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the complete flow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Raw Hide/Skin","Beamhouse","Tanning","Retanning","Dyeing","Finishing","Leather","Product Manufacturing"]},{"type":"h","text":"Semesters 5–6 — Product & Merchandising Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Footwear manufacturing"},{"text":"Leather goods"},{"text":"Bags and accessories"},{"text":"Garment leather"},{"text":"Product specifications"},{"text":"Buyer requirements"},{"text":"Product development"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Material sourcing"},{"text":"Supplier management"},{"text":"Production planning"},{"text":"Cost estimation"},{"text":"Order management"},{"text":"Quality inspection"},{"text":"Packaging"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn commercial concepts:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"BOM"},{"text":"MOQ"},{"text":"Lead time"},{"text":"Material consumption"},{"text":"Wastage"},{"text":"Labour cost"},{"text":"Overheads"},{"text":"Margin"},{"text":"FOB"},{"text":"EXW"},{"text":"Export documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semesters 7–8 — Industry & Career Preparation"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Merchandising workflow"},{"text":"Buyer communication"},{"text":"Product development"},{"text":"Production follow-up"},{"text":"Quality management"},{"text":"Supply-chain coordination"},{"text":"Export processes"},{"text":"Sustainability"},{"text":"ERP systems"},{"text":"Data analytics"},{"text":"Internship"},{"text":"Final-year project"}]}]},{"heading":"Core Knowledge Areas","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Leather Technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Leather chemistry"},{"text":"Tanning technologies"},{"text":"Chrome tanning"},{"text":"Vegetable tanning"},{"text":"Chrome-free tanning"},{"text":"Wet-blue/wet-white concepts"},{"text":"Retanning"},{"text":"Dyeing"},{"text":"Fatliquoring"},{"text":"Finishing"},{"text":"Leather grading"},{"text":"Leather defects"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Product Knowledge"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Footwear"},{"text":"Handbags"},{"text":"Wallets"},{"text":"Belts"},{"text":"Leather garments"},{"text":"Gloves"},{"text":"Accessories"},{"text":"Upholstery"},{"text":"Automotive leather"},{"text":"Technical leather products"}]}]},{"heading":"Merchandising Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A merchandiser should understand the complete order cycle:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Buyer Requirement","Product Development","Sample","Costing","A